targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:100: `extern(name, params, result)` is unsupported: Kotlin cannot call a C function
targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:352: `atomicLoad(object, order)` is unsupported: this Kotlin has no memory shared with C to read atomically
targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:353: `atomicStore(object, value, order)` is unsupported: this Kotlin has no memory shared with C to write atomically
targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:354: `atomicRmw(object, op, value, order)` is unsupported: this Kotlin has no memory shared with C to change atomically
targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:355: `cmpxchg(object, expected, value, success, failure)` is unsupported: this Kotlin has no memory shared with C to change atomically
targets/kotlin/Kotlin.translate:356: `fence(order)` is unsupported: this Kotlin has no memory shared with C to order
